  "critical_business_rules": [
    "Purchase does not own stock.",
    "Purchase must not directly execute arbitrary Stock updates.",
    "Goods Receipt is the primary Purchase operation that drives physical inventory receipt.",
    "Goods Receipt must use Inventory services for Batch/Stock/StockMovement changes.",
    "Purchase Invoice must not blindly increase stock again.",
    "Purchase Return reverses inventory through Inventory services.",
    "Partial receipts are first-class.",
    "Supplier invoice duplication must be controlled.",
    "Purchase calculations must be server authoritative.",
    "Posted purchase documents should use controlled cancellation/reversal rather than silent deletion."
